{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function compileSQLite(options, compileOptions?): SQLiteCompiledQuery;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/sqlite-compiler.ts#L45","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sqlite-compiler.ts:45"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Compiles TanStack DB LoadSubsetOptions to SQLite query components."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LoadSubsetOptions"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"compileoptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"compileOptions?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/CompileSQLiteOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"CompileSQLiteOptions"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/SQLiteCompiledQuery.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SQLiteCompiledQuery"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const compiled = compileSQLite({\n  where: { type: 'func', name: 'gt', args: [\n    { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] },\n    { type: 'val', value: 100 }\n  ]},\n  orderBy: [{ expression: { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] }, compareOptions: { direction: 'desc', nulls: 'last' } }],\n  limit: 50\n})\n// Result: { where: '\"price\" > ?', orderBy: '\"price\" DESC', limit: 50, params: [100] }","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"compileoptions","text":"compileOptions?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction compileSQLite(options, compileOptions?): SQLiteCompiledQuery;\n```\n\nDefined in: [sqlite-compiler.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/sqlite-compiler.ts#L45)\n\nCompiles TanStack DB LoadSubsetOptions to SQLite query components.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`LoadSubsetOptions`\n\n### compileOptions?\n\n[`CompileSQLiteOptions`](../interfaces/CompileSQLiteOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SQLiteCompiledQuery`](../interfaces/SQLiteCompiledQuery.md)\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst compiled = compileSQLite({\n  where: { type: 'func', name: 'gt', args: [\n    { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] },\n    { type: 'val', value: 100 }\n  ]},\n  orderBy: [{ expression: { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] }, compareOptions: { direction: 'desc', nulls: 'last' } }],\n  limit: 50\n})\n// Result: { where: '\"price\" > ?', orderBy: '\"price\" DESC', limit: 50, params: [100] }\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: compileSQLite\ntitle: compileSQLite\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction compileSQLite(options, compileOptions?): SQLiteCompiledQuery;\n```\n\nDefined in: [sqlite-compiler.ts:45](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/powersync-db-collection/src/sqlite-compiler.ts#L45)\n\nCompiles TanStack DB LoadSubsetOptions to SQLite query components.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`LoadSubsetOptions`\n\n### compileOptions?\n\n[`CompileSQLiteOptions`](../interfaces/CompileSQLiteOptions.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SQLiteCompiledQuery`](../interfaces/SQLiteCompiledQuery.md)\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst compiled = compileSQLite({\n  where: { type: 'func', name: 'gt', args: [\n    { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] },\n    { type: 'val', value: 100 }\n  ]},\n  orderBy: [{ expression: { type: 'ref', path: ['price'] }, compareOptions: { direction: 'desc', nulls: 'last' } }],\n  limit: 50\n})\n// Result: { where: '\"price\" > ?', orderBy: '\"price\" DESC', limit: 50, params: [100] }\n```\n"}
